# mindone 12.09 (F4136): a dedicated property type for the fingerprint HAL (Silead) - see
# property_contexts and hal_fingerprint_default.te. Without a dedicated type, the property
# vendor.silead.fp.ext.enable falls under the generic platform default_prop, and vendor domains are
# forbidden from writing there by an AOSP neverallow (allow triggers libsepol.report_failure, F3908).
# 13.09: must be declared through the vendor macro (adds vendor_property_type/vendor_internal_property_type);
# a bare property_type violates enforce_sysprop_owner/treble_sysprop_neverallow (ROM #1 build failure 07:23).
vendor_internal_prop(vendor_silead_fp_prop)
